#X obj 3500 300 array define \$0-shifted 25;
#X text 20 1950 The layer is latched per key at press time \, so a release carries the name its press did. Read live \, letting go of aux before the key would send og-key-72 after og-shift-72: a stuck Volca note in mode 1 (ref/device/organelle.md)., f 84;
#X text 2400 1020 Value \, pitch \, index \, write \, read \, each a trigger firing right to left: the press is decided before the pitch arrives \, and the index is in tabwrite's cold inlet before the write. C-3, f 62;
#X text 3500 380 25 elements \, one per key \, indexed pitch - 60 (item 293): an array rather than one flag keeps a chord's keys on their own layers., f 58;
